-    Formally, if :attr:`src` and :attr:`index` are :math:`n`-dimensional
-    tensors with size :math:`(x_0, ..., x_{i-1}, x_i, x_{i+1}, ..., x_{n-1})`
-    and :attr:`dim` = `i`, then :attr:`out` must be an :math:`n`-dimensional
